          "The opening has a soft white foam rim that you spread wide with your fingers. It is cut on a slant, so one edge — the taller, soft white foam edge — sits higher (the high side). Women and girls hold the high side down, pressed close against the body so nothing escapes; men and boys hold it up. Urinate straight into the bag — the super-absorbent strip at the base turns it to gel in about 60 seconds — then press the sealable closure firmly until it locks. Every pack has a simple picture guide, and most people get it right the first time.",
